IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-EXPERT-CACHE.

DATA DIVISION.
01 PREDICTIONS-COUNT   PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 CAPACITY-EXPERTS    PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 CACHED-MB           PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 HIT-RATE-PCT        PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-EXPERT-CACHE.
    IF PREDICTIONS-COUNT == 0 OR CAPACITY-EXPERTS == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    MOVE CAPACITY-EXPERTS TO CACHED-MB.
    MULTIPLY 64 BY CACHED-MB.
    MOVE 96 TO HIT-RATE-PCT.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 CACHED-MB.
    WEIGHT 30 HIT-RATE-PCT.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 15.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
